{"chapter":{"blocks":[{"text":"合成样例：只确定学段时怎么匹配","type":"TITLE"},{"key":"section-1","text":"为什么有这一章","type":"SECTION"},{"text":"这一章同样是合成内容，用来验证“学生只填了学段、没有填年级”时的匹配规则。","type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"text":"它没有任何真实教学含义，任何测试结论都不能当作课程质量结论。","type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"text":"没有年级时只按学段匹配，不推断学生年级，也不把缺少年级当成任意年级。","title":"测试要点","type":"KNOWLEDGE_CARD"}],"grade_max":null,"grade_min":null,"knowledge_points":[{"description":"合成夹具必须始终带有测试标识，并且不能进入正式发布目录。","name":"测试内容标识","slug":"fixture-notice","topic":"合成测试"}],"license_code":"SYNTHETIC-FIXTURE","objectives":["确认只填学段时仍能匹配章节","确认没有年级时不会推断年级"],"order_index":2,"revision":1,"slug":"ch02","source":{"conversion":"synthetic-original-not-from-upstream","original_sha256":"eefad4b7a64471ac8500bc71d349cbad08de6855e8ca4c4ebc4d8306011ddd0c","source_commit":"0000000000000000000000000000000000000000","source_path":"courses/t06-fixture-course/chapters/ch02.json"},"stage":"JUNIOR","title":"合成样例：只确定学段时怎么匹配"},"content_hash":"1680f53a053d9d32d69bc13fbb1b13530c49a229bed32b6845dda7614680f530","course":{"slug":"t06-fixture-course","title":"T06 合成夹具课程（非教学）","topic":"合成测试"},"is_test_fixture":true,"manifest_hash":"762a2dd3c9ffd14aa2b6fee2ac66bc7bbca8ab4cc289a986ab7e8ab82c7354ff","release_key":"synthetic-t06-fixtures-v1","schema_version":"k12.content.revision-snapshot.v1","source_kind":"SYNTHETIC_FIXTURE"}
